ases are going to go up again um  we're going to see that because there  obviously is a lag time from people  becoming infected to  having infections and then a couple of  weeks later  we'll two to three weeks later we'll  probably see an increase in the number  of deaths  so for many people it's going to be a  devastating christmas  the holiday season is only adding to  concern  a surge is expected across america  sally lockwood sky news new york
 

